# Quasar AI Delivery Skills license and third-party attributions

This file is the sole repository-level license and attribution catalog. Skill
directories must not contain copies of this catalog. License files shipped by
third-party dependencies remain with those dependencies and are not duplicates
of this file.

## Reference repositories

Some Quasar skills were adapted from or conceptually informed by material in
the following repositories. The detailed scope, revision, modifications, and
applicable license terms follow in this file. Listing a repository does not
imply endorsement by its authors.

| Reference repository | Quasar skills informed or adapted |
|---|---|
| [K-Dense-AI/scientific-agent-skills](https://github.com/K-Dense-AI/scientific-agent-skills) | `q-ideation-session`, `q-research-market-analysis`, `q-review-evidence`, `q-tool-web-markdown`, `q-tool-document`, `q-tool-pdf`, `q-tool-pptx`, and `q-tool-spreadsheet` |
| [anthropics/skills](https://github.com/anthropics/skills) | `q-tool-document`, `q-tool-pdf`, `q-tool-pptx`, and `q-tool-spreadsheet` |
| [softaworks/agent-toolkit](https://github.com/softaworks/agent-toolkit) | `q-ideation-session`, `q-tool-humanizer`, `q-review-skill`, `q-tool-c4`, `q-plan-design-system`, `q-tool-marp`, `q-tool-web-markdown`, and `q-code-grill-simple` |
| [obra/superpowers](https://github.com/obra/superpowers) | `q-code-implementation-plan`, `q-code-tickets`, `q-core-contract`, and `q-code-prototype` |
| [marp-team/marp-cli](https://github.com/marp-team/marp-cli) | `q-tool-marp` local runtime dependency |
| [leonardocouy/web2md](https://github.com/leonardocouy/web2md) | `q-tool-web-markdown` browser-capture behavior reference; not a dependency |
| [microsoft/markitdown](https://github.com/microsoft/markitdown) | `q-tool-web-markdown` comparative conversion-scope reference; not a dependency |

